.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-snapshot 1  "quarters-snapshot " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-snapshot \- Create and manage named recovery points
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-snapshot\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create and manage named recovery points
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quarters\-snapshot\-create(1)
Capture a named recovery point from an inactive Quarter
.TP
quarters\-snapshot\-list(1)
List snapshots, optionally for one exact current source identity
.TP
quarters\-snapshot\-show(1)
Show one snapshot and its integrity metadata
.TP
quarters\-snapshot\-verify(1)
Recompute and compare one snapshot\*(Aqs canonical digest
.TP
quarters\-snapshot\-rename(1)
Change a snapshot\*(Aqs display name without moving content
.TP
quarters\-snapshot\-rm(1)
Remove one whole snapshot after exact\-name confirmation
.TP
quarters\-snapshot\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
